  ('ani-nishane', 'Ani Nishane', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('baccarat-rogue', 'Baccarat rogue', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Baccarat Rouge 540 by Maison Francis Kurkdjian is one such fragrance that instantly leaves an indelible impression. Known for its radiant, amber signature, this perfume evokes a mysterious and addictive olfactory experience.', NULL, 1),
  ('baronda-massamoto', 'Baronda Massamoto', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('blue-talisman', 'Blue talisman', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('cool-water-women', 'Cool water women', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Cool Water Woman is a Fresh Aquatic Perfume for Women by Davidoff is a soft, romantic and refreshing fragrance wrapped in calming ocean-inspired notes. Sparkling citrus, melon and water florals melt into delicate rose and jasmine, then settle into a smooth, feminine base of sandalwood, vetiver and soft fruits. Shop Cool Water Woman now and experience a clean, long-lasting women''s perfume that feels light, elegant and beautifully unforgettable. It''s perfect for everyday freshness and effortless charm.', NULL, 1),
  ('couture-oud', 'Couture oud', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Oud Couture is a heavy oriental floral fragrance . Turkish rose and agarwood has never been better paired. This fragrance has people on a chokehold. Lasts over 24 hours. Sticks on you everywhere you go, changing narratives, opening doors, gliding with pride in every step you take. A major keeper.', NULL, 1),
  ('creed-carmina', 'Creed Carmina', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('decadence', 'Decadence', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('dior-sauvage', 'Dior sauvage', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Dior Sauvage Designer Fragrance Oil delivers a fresh, spicy and irresistibly smooth scent that feels clean, confident and effortlessly seductive. We''ve captured the raw, masculine spirit of this cult classic and transformed it into a luxurious, alcohol-free oil. It''s the scent you love. It is crisp, noble, and fierce but with a softer, skin-hugging finish that lasts significantly longer than a traditional spray. Cool bergamot meets woody ambroxan in a dance of pure sophistication.', NULL, 1),
  ('fahrenheit', 'Fahrenheit', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('gucci-guilty-men', 'Gucci guilty men', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Gucci Guilty Men is boldly masculine, effortlessly smooth and a scent for the rule-breaker. Embrace the essence of modern charisma with our Gucci Guilty Men inspired fragrance oil. This is the scent of freedom and individuality, reimagined in a luxurious, soft-toned oil. It''s designed for the man who is unapologetically himself, strong, mysterious, and always memorable. Top notes are Juniper, Lavender and Lemon; middle notes are Orange Blossom, Nutmeg and Spanish Labdanum; base notes are Dry Wood, Patchouli and Musk.', NULL, 1),
  ('gyan', 'Gyan', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Embark on a journey of profound elegance with Gyan. This soft-toned designer fragrance oil is a tribute to the "divine wisdom" of the East, capturing a sophisticated balance between nocturnal shadows and starlit clarity. Concentrated and alcohol-free, it is designed for the modern connoisseur who seeks a scent that is both calming and commanding. Gyan doesn''t just scent the skin; it drapes it in a rich, velvety mystery.', NULL, 1),
  ('hibiscus-mahajad', 'Hibiscus mahajad', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Inspired by tasting an infusion of hibiscus petals in the heart of a gemstone market, Hibiscus Majahad is a flamboyant, shimmering creation that glows with ruby red rose, crushed pomegranate and crystal clean mint, warmed by vanilla and amber.', NULL, 1),
  ('kutay-unique-luxury', 'Kutay unique luxury', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('limelight', 'Limelight', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('orage-lv', 'Orage Lv', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('oud-couture', 'Oud couture', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Oud Couture is a heavy oriental floral fragrance . Turkish rose and agarwood has never been better paired. This fragrance has people on a chokehold. Lasts over 24 hours. Sticks on you everywhere you go, changing narratives, opening doors, gliding with pride in every step you take. A major keeper.', NULL, 1),
  ('oud-ispahan', 'Oud ispahan', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('oud-maracuja', 'Oud Maracuja', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('oud-satin-mood', 'Oud satin Mood', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('pacific-chill', 'Pacific chill', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Pacific Chill is a fresh and uplifting fragrance inspired by the calm energy of the Pacific coast. Bright citrus, mint, and blackcurrant blend with aromatic herbs and a soft fruity base, creating a clean, modern scent that feels effortlessly elegant and refreshing.', NULL, 1),
  ('rich-leather', 'Rich leather', 'designer', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Rich Leather is a Luxury unique leathery oriental Woody Extrait Perfume is a powerful yet refined fragrance made for important meetings, special events and confident first impressions. Deep leather wrapped in smooth woody notes, spicy saffron, black pepper and ylang-ylang creates a unique, long-lasting scent that speaks success from the very first whiff. The dry down of agarwood, castoreum and patchouli seals the deal. This is like nothing you have ever experienced. Distinct, sharp, unforgettable.', NULL, 1),
