  ('2sexy2resist-edp', '2sexy2resist EDP', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', '2sexy2resist EDP is a bold, irresistible fragrance made to turn heads and leave a lasting impression. A strong intense floral fragrance that evokes the strong embrace of love and intimacy, melting into the softness of skin on skin and fresh linen sheets. The fragrance that makes hearts beat faster, manners lost, stops time because the most beautiful moments are ignited once you wear this fragrance. Loved by thousands of women and a major staple for any lady who wants to increase the spark in her relationship.', NULL, 1),
  ('b17', 'B17', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'B17 is a smooth, modern eau de parfum that melts into your skin and leaves you wanting for more. An explosion of lavender, jasmine, vanilla and sandalwood.', NULL, 1),
  ('b18', 'B18', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'B18 Eau de Parfum is a clean, modern fragrance with soft florals, gentle aromatics and a creamy woody-musky base for a long-lasting, elegant signature scent.', NULL, 1),
  ('b21', 'B21', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'B21 Eau de Parfum is a clean, modern unisex fragrance with soft florals, gentle aromatics and a creamy woody-musky base for an elegant, long-lasting signature scent. B21 is a smooth, modern fragrance designed to melt into your skin and leave a gentle, confident trail that feels fresh, polished and quietly irresistible. It is Easy to wear, easy to love, and perfect for every day.', NULL, 1),
  ('b23', 'B23', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'B23 is a smooth, modern eau de parfum designed to sit effortlessly on your skin and leave a calm, confident trail wherever you go. It is a clean, modern unisex fragrance with soft florals, gentle aromatics and a creamy woody musky base for an elegant, long-lasting signature scent.', NULL, 1),
  ('b24', 'B24', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'B24 Eau de Parfum is a sweet amber gourmand scent that screams lick me up. A sexy edible fragrance that,makes you almost get licked up. A creamy delicious lactonic fragrance with a blend of caramel, sandalwood, toffee, vanilla and oud.', NULL, 1),
  ('b25', 'B25', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'B25 is a soft yet confident everyday fragrance designed to sit beautifully on the skin and leave a calm, unforgettable trail. A fresh citrusy woody eau de parfum for clean conscious individuals. Easy to spray yet lingers all day.Effortless, modern and easy to love... this is the kind of scent that feels right from the first spray.', NULL, 1),
  ('b27', 'B27', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'B27 Eau de Parfum is a clean, modern unisex fragrance with soft florals, gentle aromatics and a creamy woody-musky base for an elegant, long-lasting scent. It is a smooth, everyday luxury fragrance designed to sit beautifully on your skin and leave a clean, confident trail that never feels loud.', NULL, 1),
  ('bare-secrets', 'Bare secrets', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Bare Secrets is a sensual sweet floral fragrance that doesn''t scream for attention but somehow gets it anyway. Soft musks, delicate florals, and clean notes melt into your skin instead of sitting on top of it giving you something personal and intimate rather than overpowering. You need this if you''re the woman who''s tired of perfumes that announce themselves before you even walk in. If you love the kind of compliments that come with "you smell so good, what is that?" whispered close, not shouted across the room. This one lets people get close enough to actually notice you.', NULL, 1),
  ('bare-skin', 'Bare skin', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Some fragrances make an impression. Bare Skin creates an obsession. The first spray is impossible to predict. Musky, mossy, metallic, earthy, and wrapped in a sharp tropical freshness, it unfolds into something deeply sensual and incredibly intriguing. Bright mandarin meets the warmth of saffron and caramel before rose, precious woods, vanilla, and oakmoss create a scent that feels intimate, magnetic, and unforgettable. Bare Skin was made for moments that deserve to be remembered. Romantic dinners, special nights, quiet conversations that turn into unforgettable memories. It has the kind of chemistry that keeps people leaning in for one more hug, one more compliment, one more excuse to stay close. If you''re not ready to be consumed!!! Avoid this Notes: Mandarin • Saffron • Caramel • Rose • Woods • Vanilla • Oakmoss.', NULL, 1),
  ('breaking-rules', 'Breaking rules', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'There is a reason women keep coming back to Breaking rules Fresh, aromatic, tropical, citrusy, lightly spicy, and wrapped in a delicious fruity sweetness, this is the kind of fragrance that instantly lifts your mood. It opens with juicy passion fruit and cherry before settling into the richness of oak and agarwood, leaving behind a sweet, refreshing trail that is impossible to ignore. Breaking is playful, feminine, and incredibly addictive. It is the perfect fragrance for date nights, weekend outings, vacations, and every moment you want to smell effortlessly attractive. Sweet without being overwhelming and refreshing from the first spray to the last, this is one of those fragrances you''ll never get tired of wearing. Notes: Passion Fruit • Cherry • Oak • Agarwood.', NULL, 1),
  ('honey-trap', 'Honey trap', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Honeytrap carries a secret you can almost taste at each spray. A blend of caramel, white chocolate, almonds, vanilla, brown sugar, and praline into a light, irresistible fragrance. This gourmand-lactonic perfume does not whisper. It snatches hearts, forcing them to bury their nose deep into your skin, licking you up all the way and randomly spoiling you with compliments. This fragrance could make you to literally chew yourself up. Be warned!!!. Perfect for intimate moments, romantic escapes, days you want to make people drool over you for good. Add to cart instantly. This is not your regular.', NULL, 1),
  ('ijele', 'Ijele', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'IJELE Extrait Perfume is a beautifully intense extrait perfume created to sit close to your skin and leave a slow, unforgettable trail. Smooth, comforting and softly seductive, this is a scent that feels personal, confident and effortlessly elegant from the first spray. Strictly made for those who love the spotlight. A deep dirty floral fragrance, decadent enough to have everyone whispering your name and asking what''s the sauce. Ijele is a niche masterpiece.', NULL, 1),
  ('lavida-loca', 'Lavida loca', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Lavida Loca is a deliciously sweet gourmand fragrance wrapped in soft oriental notes that melts into your skin and lingers beautifully all day. Its a best-selling ladies'' perfume for women who love to stand out effortlessly. Want to be licked up? This does this. Wear this and you will have to keep saying no to the opposite gender. This is a major man eater seduction fragrance. A weapon for ladies that know.', NULL, 1),
  ('little-miss-temptation', 'Little miss temptation', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'LITTLE miss temptation Extrait Perfume is a fragrance of soft life, romance, and effortless femininity. This wild juicy-bubble-gum explosion will have you smelling like what needs to be eaten up in real time. A dreamy blend of berries, cinnamon, yellow mandarin, jasmine, and patchouli that turns heads gently and leaves a beautiful, girly aura behind. It is perfect for brides, date nights, romantic dinners, or cozy luxury days. If you''re stepping into your soft-girl era, this is your fragrance.', NULL, 1),
  ('lush-life', 'Lush life', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'With carefully selected notes that balance freshness, warmth, and sensual depth, Lush Life Fragrance Extract enhances your presence effortlessly, whether for everyday wear or special occasions. Just a small application unveils a long-lasting fragrance experience that evolves gracefully throughout the day. Fragrance Profile: Top Notes: Fresh and vibrant accents that awaken the senses Heart Notes: Soft, floral or aromatic layers that add character Base Notes: Deep, warm undertones for a lasting signature Key Features: Highly concentrated for long-lasting wear Smooth, rich scent with a luxurious finish Suitable for both day and evening use Crafted for individuals who value elegance.', NULL, 1),
  ('mind-games', 'Mind games', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Mind Game, an Extrait de Parfum designed for those who play to win. This is the pinnacle of twisted, intriguing intensity; a fragrance that combines high-concentration power with a smooth, velvety finish. This fragrance is a mind twister that gets people crawling for more. You''ll never imagine all the ways this fragrance gets to clutch at your heart, sweep you off your feet and effortlessly makes you fall in love completely with every whiff. A super blend of grapefruit, tangerine, rose, opopanax . you miss this, you truly missed a gem.', NULL, 1),
  ('opulent-pink-box', 'Opulent pink box', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'A variety box with four variants of fragrances. Unveil a world of rosy luxury with the Opulent Pink Box. This curated gift package is a love letter to the modern woman, bringing together our most enchanting, soft-toned fragrances in one breathtaking collection. From powdery florals to sun-kissed sweetness, each scent is a masterclass in elegance, designed to make her feel as radiant as she looks.', NULL, 1),
  ('peak-of-passion', 'Peak of passion', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('pulze', 'Pulze', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('raw', 'Raw', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('rich-tension', 'Rich tension', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Rich Tension Extrait de Perfume is the invisible pull that makes people lean in, without even realising. It is a clean, non-toxic luxury perfume crafted with lavender absolute, petitgrain, lime, galbanum, clary sage, olibanum and labdanum. This unisex perfume is bold, complex and dangerously addictive. Smells powerful. Feels expensive. Leaves tension in the air in every room you step into.', NULL, 1),
  ('risky-fire', 'Risky fire', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('secret-flame', 'Secret flame', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Secret Flame, a natural extrait that defines soft-toned seduction. This isn''t a roaring fire; it''s the mesmerizing warmth of a glowing ember. Crafted with the highest concentration of botanical ingredients, Secret Flame is designed to meld with your skin''s natural chemistry, creating a magnetic, sophisticated aura that feels like a beautiful secret shared between you and your skin.', NULL, 1),
  ('sensuality-burst', 'Sensuality burst', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Sensuality Burst is seductive fragrance designed to evoke deep desires and provide a lingering, intimate aroma. It is a musky floral scent designed to create a memorable, and alluring impression. This fragrant oil is designed to melt into your skin and release a warm, intimate trail that quietly turns heads. Smooth, comforting and deeply seductive. This is your soft-power scent.', NULL, 1),
  ('sexy-time', 'Sexy time', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Sexy Time is a smoky fresh, seductive eau de parfum with juicy fruits, woody oriental notes and a warm vanilla musky base for an irresistible everyday signature scent.', NULL, 1),
  ('slow-k-ller', 'Slow k!ller', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Slow Killer is the fragrance they warned you about. Woody, spicy, floral, sweet, citrusy, ambery, and softly powdery, it has a way of completely mesmerizing everyone who experiences it. Orange blossom and jasmine open the fragrance with effortless elegance before amber, sandalwood, and vanilla create a rich, addictive dry down with a juicy citrus twist that keeps you wanting another sniff. This is an iconic scent. It smells expensive during the day, becomes irresistible at night, and somehow gets even better as the hours go by. The projection is beautiful, the trail is unforgettable, and it never feels overpowering. It is one of those rare fragrances you can confidently blind buy and instantly fall in love with. Perfect for both women and men, Slow Killer is made for work, date nights, special occasions, and every season of the year. Notes: Orange Blossom • Jasmine • Amber • Sandalwood • Vanilla.', NULL, 1),
  ('snatched', 'Snatched', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'SNATCHED is a custom Aqua perfume and the ultimate man-eater energy in a bottle. It is bold, magnetic, and unapologetically addictive. This limited-edition luxury perfume is made to steal attention, steal hearts and leave your name in someone''s mind long after you''ve gone. One spray and you''re centre stage, instantly. This floral woody gourmand creation fuses the juicy sweetness of fruit with the delicate freshness of blooming flowers, revealing an explosion ASSn of unfiltered joy and pure pleasure. At the heart of this perfume lies the sensuality of the gardenia flower, magnified by rich, woody nuances that quicken the pulse and stir the senses.Snatched is dangerously sexy, powerfully feminine and impossible to forget.', NULL, 1),
  ('stuck-on-me', 'Stuck on me', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Stuck on me is a romantic floral-fruity fragrance for women, featuring a blend of sweet strawberry, black currant, peony, and vanilla musk. It mainly consists of big, plump, juicy, sweet strawberries and hearty patchouli! A touch of Sweetness. It''s girly, gently seductive, and oh so pretty! It smells good enough to eat! This is sweetness overload. A top choice of people who love to smell like what needs to be eaten up. This fragrance is super long lasting, activates a rush of love hormones. Wear this when you want the opposite gender to forget time. A must-have for every woman.', NULL, 1),
  ('sweet-addiction', 'Sweet addiction', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Sweet Addiction is a heavy Floral Fragrance Oil for Women is a soft yet irresistible blend of juicy blood orange, golden honey and creamy gardenia that melts beautifully into your skin. This addictive, long-lasting women''s perfume oil keeps evolving throughout the day and layers perfectly with almost all MajesticRoobee body mists. A best seller.', NULL, 1),
  ('sweet-berry-pop', 'Sweet berry pop', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Sweet Berry Pop is a juicy seductive blend where playful sweetness meets a deep, smoldering intensity. This is captivating and impossible to resist. We''ve combined the flirtatious notes of ripe fruits with the sophisticated warmth of dark gourmands to create a custom oil that feels like a velvet embrace.', NULL, 1),
  ('sweet-trouble', 'Sweet trouble', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Sweet Trouble is one of those fragrances you don''t expect to fall in love with... until the very first spray. Fresh, sweet, green, ambery, fruity, lightly spicy, and beautifully aquatic, it is a scent that feels vibrant, feminine, and effortlessly captivating. Bright mandarin and juicy pear blend with fresh green nuances before melting into the richness of patchouli and smooth caramel, creating a fragrance that is both comforting and incredibly addictive. It is perfect for work, beautiful enough for evenings, and versatile enough to become a signature scent. Sweet Trouble is the kind of fragrance every woman should experience at least once because once you smell it, you''ll understand why so many women never want to let it go. Notes: Mandarin • Green Nuances • Pear • Patchouli • Caramel.', NULL, 1),
  ('terri-3', 'Terri 3', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Terri3 Extrait de Perfume is the most versatile fragrance your body silently craves but does not realize it until you spray it. Terri3 is a spell of massive confidence. This amber-musky fragrance,gives a feel-good, I can conquer the world vibes. A bold fusion of the highly priced ambrette seed oil, cashmere wood, violet leaf, mandarin, clary sage,vetiver and musk that grips the senses and boosts confidence instantly. Terri3 is Magnetic, addictive, and unforgettable. Terri3 isn''t just a fragrance ,it''s an aura, a mood, a game-changer.', NULL, 1),
  ('the-topic', 'The topic', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'For the woman who never needs to announce her arrival. TOPIC is bold, spicy, woody, and deeply earthy. It opens with the freshness of bergamot and juniper, unfolds into warm cardamom and mysterious black rose, then melts into the rich depth of immortelle and smooth benzoin, creating an unforgettable scent trail that stays with you for hours. This is the fragrance you wear when you want your confidence to speak before you do. Powerful without being loud. Sophisticated without trying too hard. It naturally commands attention, earns respect, and leaves people wondering who just walked past. Its intense, long-lasting composition makes it the perfect companion for work, important meetings, formal occasions, and every moment you want to leave a lasting impression. It also layers beautifully with every fragrance inside the TAC Box, allowing you to create a smell game that is uniquely yours. Notes: Bergamot • Juniper • Cardamom • Black Rose • Immortelle • Benzoin.', NULL, 1),
  ('vanilla-explosion', 'Vanilla explosion', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Vanilla Explosion is a Rich Madagascar vanilla blend with warm benzoin and smooth labdanum to create something sophisticated, comforting, and shockingly long-lasting. You need this if you love smelling expensive without trying. If you want a scent that wraps around you like a warm hug and stays on your skin hours after you''ve forgotten you sprayed it. This is vanilla for grown women, elegant, not childish. Deep, not basic.', NULL, 1),
  ('walking-daydream', 'Walking daydream', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Walking Daydream Extrait Perfume is soft, luxurious, and quietly unforgettable. Peach, nectarine, black currant, iris, vanilla, tonka bean, and musk melt into a refined scent that blooms on your skin and turns heads effortlessly. This subtle floral blend is addictive, and beautifully you. The kind of perfume that brings back your sexiness, whispers your name and sends soft hugs and shivers down the spine with every whiff.', NULL, 1),
  ('wild-by-default', 'Wild by default', 'extrait', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Wild by Default Extrait Perfume is a seductive blend of myrrh, oakmoss, agarwood and violet leaf that opens sweet... then slowly pulls you in with an irresistible, addictive grip. Softens every edge. Melts every tension. This aromatic Fougere perfume is warm, intimate, and dangerously unforgettable. Wild by Default smells like comfort, feels like desire and stays like a memory. If you want to be remembered long after you''ve left the space, wear this.', NULL, 1),
  ('armpitox', 'Armpitox', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Your underarms deserve more than just a cover-up. Introducing Armpitox, the soft-toned detox treatment that purifies, brightens, and balances your most sensitive skin. Designed to bridge the gap between high-end skincare and daily hygiene, Armpitox draws out impurities and neutralizes odors at the source. It''s the essential "reset button" for a fresher, healthier, and more confident you.', NULL, 1),
  ('bikini-booster', 'Bikini booster', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'The bikini booster is a natural water and aloe-based lubricant infused with pheromones combine moisturizing, skin-safe ingredients with scent-based additives designed to enhance attraction and arousal. It mimics the body''s natural moisture and maintains vaginal pH balance. It is also free from fragrance, petrochemicals, and parabens, including synthetic colours and flavours. Unlock a new level of confidence with the Bikini Booster. This soft-toned, high-performance serum is specifically formulated to rejuvenate and enhance your most delicate skin. Whether you''re looking to smooth texture, even out skin tone, or simply add a healthy glow, this booster acts as a daily shot of radiance for your bikini line, making intimate moments to be smooth, addictive and pleasurable.', NULL, 1),
  ('bikini-brightening-cream', 'Bikini brightening cream', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Reveal your most radiant skin with the Bikini Brightening Cream. Specifically designed for your most intimate and sensitive areas; from the bikini line to underarms, this soft-toned treatment targets hyperpigmentation and shadows with the precision of high-end facial skincare. It''s not just about correcting; it''s about nurturing your skin back to its natural, luminous glow.', NULL, 1),
  ('bikini-freshener-mist', 'Bikini freshener mist', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Confidence shouldn''t have a curfew. Meet Bikini Freshener, the ultimate soft-toned mist designed for your most delicate areas. Whether you''re heading to the beach, the gym, or a long date night, this feather-light deodorant spray provides an instant burst of cooling comfort and a clean, subtle scent that keeps you feeling petal-fresh and dry. It is designed to provide daily freshness, odor control, and comfort for the external intimate area. Formulated to be gentle, help maintain pH balance, reduce bad smelling sweat, and prevent irritation. It is free from alcohol and formulated with plant extracts. Elevate your intimate care routine with products that prioritize your well-being and confidence. Explore our range of bikini products for a refreshing experience.', NULL, 1),
  ('bikini-oil', 'Bikini oil', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Our Bikini Oil Refill is the soft-toned, eco-conscious way to ensure your skin never spends a day without its signature silkiness. Designed to perfectly top up your original glass bottle, this refill preserves your intimate skincare ritual while treading lighter on the planet. It''s the same liquid gold you love; nourishing, brightening, and soothing; bottled with the future in mind.', NULL, 1),
  ('bikini-oil-refill', 'Bikini oil refill', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Our Bikini Oil Refill is the soft-toned, eco-conscious way to ensure your skin never spends a day without its signature silkiness. Designed to perfectly top up your original glass bottle, this refill preserves your intimate skincare ritual while treading lighter on the planet. It''s the same liquid gold you love; nourishing, brightening, and soothing; bottled with the future in mind.', NULL, 1),
  ('bikini-package', 'Bikini package', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('bikini-wash', 'Bikini wash', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Bikini Wash is a bikini feminine was is free of harmful chemicals to give you a simple, non-toxic, pH balancing formula infused with kinds of natural extracts. no sulphates, dyes or fragrances. Made from pure plant ingredients, made from Aloe vera, essential oils and plant derived surfactants. Toxic intimate care products can throw your pH out of balance. Use the ph balance for women intimate wash to keep your sensitive area healthy, clean and fresh day after day without disrupting their natural pH balance. Easy to use. Simply apply 1-2 pumps on clean, dry palm and gently rub all over intimate area to cleanse. No douching. After cleansing, rinse off with water, pat dry and follow up immediately with up to 4 to 5 pumps of the bikini oil. Rub all over private part The bikini Wash is gentle by nature and fresh design for your premium feminine care.', NULL, 1),
  ('cranbiotic-gummies', 'Cranbiotic gummies', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Experience the natural power of cranberries in a convenient, delicious form with our cranbiotic gummies. It''s made to support freshness, comfort and intimate balance, promote urinary and gut health balance, these delicious concentrated cranberry extract gummies help you feel clean, confident and beautifully in tune with your body. Each gummy delivers the protective benefits of cranberries, rich in antioxidants that help prevent bacteria from adhering to the urinary tract lining. Beyond urinary health, the antioxidant properties of cranberries support a healthy immune system, making these gummies a powerhouse addition to your daily routine. Designed for convenience and enjoyment, our cranbiotic Gummies are free from artificial additives. They''re an easy and tasty way to stay proactive about your health. Rediscover the joy of wellness with the cranbiotic Gummies , your delicious daily partner for a healthy urinary tract, gut health and vibrant lifestyle.', NULL, 1),
  ('freshness-gummies', 'Freshness gummies', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', '', NULL, 1),
  ('hello-fresh-pits', 'Hello fresh pits', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Hello Fresh Pits (Feminine Care & Deodorant). Wave goodbye to odours and say hello to freshness. Confidence starts with a clean slate. Hello Fresh Pits is our premium, soft-toned solution for all day freshness that actually cares for your skin. Designed specifically for the feminine silhouette, this isn''t just a deodorant; it''s a total body care essential. Whether it''s a high-intensity workout or a long day at the office, stay dry, smell divine, and feel effortlessly cool.', NULL, 1),
  ('spa-set', 'Spa set', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Why choose one when you can have it all? The Bikini Spa Set is a curated, soft-toned collection designed to transform your intimate skincare into a high-end spa experience. From exfoliation to deep hydration and brightening, this three-step system works in perfect harmony to ensure your bikini area is silky-smooth, even-toned, and irresistibly soft. It''s the ultimate investment in your body''s comfort and radiance.', NULL, 1),
  ('yummy-bikini-oil', 'Yummy bikini oil', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'Yummypum bikini Oil is a pure, gentle, and deliciously fresh intimate oil. The ultimate glow-up for your most intimate skin. Reclaim your confidence with the yummypum bikini oil, a premium feminine care oil designed to nourish, soothe, and scent your delicate areas with soft-toned perfection. This isn''t just a treatment; it''s a daily ritual of self-love. Crafted with plant-based botanicals, Yummypum bikini oil ensures you feel fresh, smell fresh down there, hydrated, and irresistibly smooth from morning to night, increases your body''s natural lubrication even during intercourse, enhances and tones the vulva walls after post partum, increases your snap back confidence , shields you from mild infections, prevents shaving bumps and over all, helps you glide through all phases of womanhood with pride.', NULL, 1),
  ('yummy-bikini-wash', 'Yummy bikini wash', 'care', 'Unisex', '', '', 'The yummypum bikini feminine wash is free of harmful chemicals to bikini kinds of natural extracts. no sulphates, dyes or fragrances. Made from pure plant ingredients, made from Aloe vera, essential oils and plant derived surfactants. Toxic intimate care products can throw your pH out of balance. Use the ph balance for women intimate wash to keep your sensitive area healthy, clean and fresh day after day without disrupting their natural pH balance. Easy to use. Simply apply 1-2 pumps on clean, dry palm and gently rub all over intimate area to cleanse. No douching. After cleansing, rinse off with water, pat dry and follow up immediately with up to 4 to 5 pumps of the yummypum bikini oil. Rub all over private part Yummypum bikini Wash is gentle by nature and fresh by design for your premium feminine care.', NULL, 1),
